00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:30.560
we're going to lift up this bottom flap
and we're going to tuck this corner into

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.990
the paper just like we just folded it so
just fold it back on that crease and

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:42.800
then we could refold the bottom flap
back up just like that do the same with

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:49.430
the bottom left corner: lift up the top
flap here refold the bottom left corner

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:54.289
and then you can just put the flap back
